      "message": "This is going to stop the `fp_task`. I\u0027m not sure if that\u0027s going to cause problems, so you\u0027ll need to test it. Host commands will run on a different task, so they should still run, but we want to make sure it\u0027s obvious on the caller side what is happening.",
