        "id": 1541085
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-10-24T16:07:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Do you mean that I generate a firmware that returns a nullptr, flash it, and then try for example `ectool` commands and see what happens?\n\nHow about not checking in here. I will check before `global_context.fp_frame_size_cache-\u003eget_frame_size` is called that `global_context.fp_frame_size_cache` is not a nullptr.\n\n```\nif (global_context.fp_frame_size_cache) {\n    global_context.current_frame_size \u003d\n        global_context.fp_frame_size_cache-\u003eget_frame_size(\n            capture_type);\n} else {\n    CPRINTS(\"FP frame size cache is NULL. Cannot determine frame size for type %d.\", capture_type);    \n    global_context.current_frame_size \u003d 0;\n}\n```",
      "parentUuid": "c30332cf_41fbbc54",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 253,
